silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_manifest_verification #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Manifest Verification and Provenance Gaps' the bare symbol YonedaProfile anchors to VetRecordAboutMittens: The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling.." .
